  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The position of the final image will be independent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>,&nbsp;only if the rays of light are incident on the concave lens as a beam parallel to the principal axis. This will be possible only when the object is kept at focus of&nbsp; the plano-convex lens.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>∞</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
